      "review": {
        "status": "proposed",
        "proposedBy": "chatgpt",
        "proposedOn": "2026-09-25",
        "notes": "Exact fixtures are specified by requested length within the published tolerance. Optimal lengths are rounded down using QTL's Exact/Optimal Fixture Length charts; those charts are not yet encoded, so AV-SW must not calculate Optimal lengths yet."
